{"cues":[{"s":14.67,"e":16.33,"de":"Hallo.","en":"Hello.","fa":"سلام."},{"s":17.0,"e":19.0,"de":"Du möchtest das Zimmer sehen, oder?","en":"You'd like to see the room, right?","fa":"تو می‌خواهی اتاق را ببینی، درست است؟"},{"s":19.0,"e":20.33,"de":"Ja, genau.","en":"Yes, exactly.","fa":"بله، درست است."},{"s":20.67,"e":22.0,"de":"Ist das schon weg?","en":"Has it been taken already?","fa":"هنوز خالی است؟"},{"s":22.0,"e":23.0,"de":"Nein, nein.","en":"No, no.","fa":"نه، نه."},{"s":23.67,"e":24.67,"de":"Komm nur rein.","en":"Come on in.","fa":"بیا تو."},{"s":24.67,"e":25.67,"de":"Danke.","en":"Thanks.","fa":"ممنون."},{"s":27.33,"e":29.33,"de":"Ähm, ich heiße Paul.","en":"Um, I'm Paul.","fa":"هوم، اسم من پاول است."},{"s":29.33,"e":31.0,"de":"Ich bin Elke.","en":"","fa":"من الکه هستم."},{"s":31.33,"e":32.0,"de":"Aha.","en":"Right.","fa":"آها."},{"s":36.33,"e":38.67,"de":"Also, pass auf,","en":"Okay, listen.","fa":"خب، گوش کن،"},{"s":39.0,"e":40.67,"de":"die Wohnung hat vier Zimmer","en":"The flat has four rooms","fa":"آپارتمان چهار اتاق دارد"},{"s":40.67,"e":46.67,"de":"und eine Küche, ein Bad und eine Toilette.","en":"plus a kitchen, a bathroom, and a toilet.","fa":"و یک آشپزخانه، یک حمام و یک توالت."},{"s":49.0,"e":52.0,"de":"Das Bad und die Toilette sind gleich hier vorn.","en":"The bathroom and the toilet are just up ahead.","fa":"حمام و توالت همین‌جا جلو هستند."},{"s":53.33,"e":55.33,"de":"Hier links ist die Toilette","en":"The toilet is here on the left,","fa":"اینجا سمت چپ توالت است"},{"s":56.33,"e":59.67,"de":"und hier rechts ist das Bad.","en":"and the bathroom is here on the right.","fa":"و اینجا سمت راست حمام."},{"s":63.0,"e":66.0,"de":"Boah, wie sauber ist das denn?","en":"Wow, it's so clean!","fa":"وای، چقدر تمیز است!"},{"s":66.0,"e":68.33,"de":"Das sieht ja richtig toll aus.","en":"It looks really great.","fa":"واقعاً عالی به نظر می‌رسد."},{"s":68.67,"e":71.67,"de":"Tja, Masoud braucht Ordnung.","en":"Well, Massood needs things tidy.","fa":"خب، مسعود نظم لازم د